estige & Above (P&A) portfolio, and record-high quarterly volumes of 10 million cases.","themes":{"guidance":[{"claim":"Management upgraded the Prestige & Above volume growth guidance to 30% for FY27.","quote":"We upgrade our Prestige & Above volume growth guidance to 30% and reiterate EBITDA margin guidance of around 20% for FY27.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-10-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f9f21f48-c1dd-4da6-aabb-57871a555bd1.pdf"},{"claim":"The company expects its P&A portfolio to deliver over 25% volume growth during FY27.","quote":"Looking ahead, we expect our P&A portfolio to deliver over 25% volume growth during FY27, supported by a robust innovation pipeline, expanding distribution and favorable industry trends.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d7c04be2-c834-47ac-b6bf-7f982fdbcce5.pdf"},{"claim":"Management is confident of sustaining an EBITDA margin of around 20% for FY27.","quote":"With premium brands accounting for an increasing share of our business, we remain confident of sustaining EBITDA margin of around 20% for FY27 while continuing to invest behind our brands and strengthen our long-term competitive position.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d7c04be2-c834-47ac-b6bf-7f982fdbcce5.pdf"}],"demand_outlook":[{"claim":"Prestige & Above portfolio volume grew 35.8% in Q2 FY2027.","quote":"Prestige & Above category volume grew 35.8%.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-10-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f9f21f48-c1dd-4da6-aabb-57871a555bd1.pdf"},{"claim":"The Indian spirits industry continues to benefit from strengthening structural tailwinds, with Karnataka showing early signs of a healthier, more premium-friendly market.","quote":"The IMFL industry continues to benefit from strengthening structural tailwinds. In Karnataka, the rationalised duty framework is showing early signs of a healthier, more premium-friendly market.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-10-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f9f21f48-c1dd-4da6-aabb-57871a555bd1.pdf"},{"claim":"Tamil Nadu is also sending encouraging signals as the country's largest market.","quote":"Tamil Nadu, the country’s largest market, is also sending encouraging signals.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-10-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f9f21f48-c1dd-4da6-aabb-57871a555bd1.pdf"},{"claim":"Vodka is experiencing a multi-year structural shift with its share of the IMFL industry rising to 6.3% in Q2 FY27.","quote":"Vodka is in the midst of a multi-year structural shift, and its share of the IMFL industry has risen to 6.3% in Q2 FY27.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-10-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f9f21f48-c1dd-4da6-aabb-57871a555bd1.pdf"},{"claim":"Magic Moments delivered 3.25 million cases at a growth rate of 43% year-on-year during the quarter.","quote":"The brand delivered a landmark performance during the quarter with 3.25 million cases at a growth rate of 43% year-on-year.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d7c04be2-c834-47ac-b6bf-7f982fdbcce5.pdf"},{"claim":"Flavored vodka accounts for 75% of vodka volumes, up from 65% last year.","quote":"Flavored vodka today accounts for 75% of our volumes, up from 65% last year.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d7c04be2-c834-47ac-b6bf-7f982fdbcce5.pdf"},{"claim":"Spirits sales in India are estimated to reach 416 million cases in CY2025, representing an increase of 3.9% over CY2024.","quote":"Spirits sales in India is estimated to be at 416 million cases in CY2025, representing an increase of 3.9% over CY2024","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=ec961816-2f10-4e31-a2c6-6d0a287b8b0e.pdf"},{"claim":"IMFL sales volume is expected to grow at a CAGR of 3.5% and sales value at 6.8% during the CY2025-30 period.","quote":"During CY2025-30 period, IMFL sales volume is expected to grow at a CAGR of 3.5% and sales value at 6.8%","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=ec961816-2f10-4e31-a2c6-6d0a287b8b0e.pdf"},{"claim":"White spirits, Vodka and Gin, remain the fastest growing category in volume and value terms.","quote":"White spirits, Vodka and Gin, remain the fastest growing category in volume and value terms","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=ec961816-2f10-4e31-a2c6-6d0a287b8b0e.pdf"}],"capex_expansion":[{"claim":"Annual maintenance capex is projected to be in the range of Rs. 150 crores to Rs. 170 crores.","quote":"So as of now, our maintenance capex would be in the range of Rs. 150 crores to Rs. 170 crores.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d7c04be2-c834-47ac-b6bf-7f982fdbcce5.pdf"}],"margins_costs":[{"claim":"Gross Margin for Q2 FY2027 was 48.0%, representing a 440 bps expansion year-on-year.","quote":"Gross Margin during the quarter was 48.0%, representing a 440 bps expansion Y-o-Y.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-10-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f9f21f48-c1dd-4da6-aabb-57871a555bd1.pdf"},{"claim":"To mitigate increasing grain prices, the company built up higher levels of stocks which supported Q2 FY27 but resulted in higher working capital.","quote":"To mitigate the impact of increasing grain prices to a large extent, we had built up higher level of stocks which has supported us through Q2 FY27. This has resulted into higher working capital during the quarter.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-10-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f9f21f48-c1dd-4da6-aabb-57871a555bd1.pdf"},{"claim":"Management expects to maintain A&SP spend around 6% to 8% of IMFL revenues.","quote":"On a quarterly basis, the amount may vary but we expect to maintain A&SP spend around 6% to 8% of our IMFL revenues to be able to drive the sales momentum.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-10-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f9f21f48-c1dd-4da6-aabb-57871a555bd1.pdf"},{"claim":"Packing material volatility resulted in approximately Rs. 30 crores of financial impact.","quote":"This is despite the recent volatility in the packing material prices, which resulted in approximately Rs. 30 crores of financial impact.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d7c04be2-c834-47ac-b6bf-7f982fdbcce5.pdf"},{"claim":"EBITDA margin for the quarter stood at 20.7%, expanding by 536 basis points year-on-year.","quote":"EBITDA margin for the quarter stood at 20.7%, expanding by 536 basis points year-on-year to its highest-ever level.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d7c04be2-c834-47ac-b6bf-7f982fdbcce5.pdf"},{"claim":"Prestige & Above brands growth has led to a sustainable improvement in realization per case.","quote":"Leading to a sustainable improvement in the realization per case","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=ec961816-2f10-4e31-a2c6-6d0a287b8b0e.pdf"}],"orders_capacity":[{"claim":"Total ENA requirement is between 28 crores to 30 crores liters, while the company makes 33 crores liters across its plants.","quote":"So, our total requirement is in the range of around 28 crores to 30 crores liters between our IMFL and non-IMFL both put together, and for Rampur plant, Sitapur plant and our joint venture, we make 33 crores liters.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d7c04be2-c834-47ac-b6bf-7f982fdbcce5.pdf"},{"claim":"Radico Khaitan has 323 million liters of total capacity across its distilleries.","quote":"Total 10 61.3 257.4 4.6 323.3","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=ec961816-2f10-4e31-a2c6-6d0a287b8b0e.pdf"}],"capital_allocation":[{"claim":"Net debt was reduced by Rs. 68.7 Crore since March 31, 2026.","quote":"Reduction in Net Debt of ` 68.7 Cr since March 31, 2026; Net Debt free during H2 FY2027","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-10-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f9f21f48-c1dd-4da6-aabb-57871a555bd1.pdf"},{"claim":"Total debt included term loans of Rs. 54.3 Cr, reflecting a reduction in term loans of Rs. 75.7 Cr since March 31, 2026.","quote":"Including Term Loans of ` 54.3 Cr (reduction in TL of ` 75.7 Cr since March 31, 2026)","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-10-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f9f21f48-c1dd-4da6-aabb-57871a555bd1.pdf"},{"claim":"The balance sheet remains strong and the company is on track to become net debt-free by Q2 FY27.","quote":"Our balance sheet remains strong and we are on track to become net debt free by Q2 FY27.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d7c04be2-c834-47ac-b6bf-7f982fdbcce5.pdf"}],"risks_headwinds":[{"claim":"The global environment has turned increasingly volatile with heightened uncertainty around input costs and supply chains.","quote":"The global environment has turned increasingly volatile, with heightened uncertainty around input costs and supply chains.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-10-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f9f21f48-c1dd-4da6-aabb-57871a555bd1.pdf"},{"claim":"The business operates within a dynamic global environment marked by geopolitical uncertainties and supply chain challenges.","quote":"Despite a dynamic global environment, marked by geopolitical uncertainties and supply chain challenges, we expanded our operating margins through a richer product mix, disciplined cost management and continued operational excellence.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d7c04be2-c834-47ac-b6bf-7f982fdbcce5.pdf"}]},"management_commitments":[{"claim":"The company expects to be net debt-free during H2 FY2027.","quote":"Net Debt free during H2 FY2027","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-10-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f9f21f48-c1dd-4da6-aabb-57871a555bd1.pdf","timeframe":"H2 FY26"},{"claim":"The company is steadily progressing towards its target of 100 travel retail outlets in the coming years.","quote":"Building on around 70 travel retail outlets currently, we are steadily progressing towards our target of 100 in the coming years.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-10-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=f9f21f48-c1dd-4da6-aabb-57871a555bd1.pdf","timeframe":"next 2 years"},{"claim":"The company expects to become net debt free by Q2 FY27.","quote":"Our balance sheet remains strong and we are on track to become net debt free by Q2 FY27.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d7c04be2-c834-47ac-b6bf-7f982fdbcce5.pdf","timeframe":"Q2 FY27"},{"claim":"Management is confident of sustaining an EBITDA margin of around 20% for FY27.","quote":"With premium brands accounting for an increasing share of our business, we remain confident of sustaining EBITDA margin of around 20% for FY27 while continuing to invest behind our brands and strengthen our long-term competitive position.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d7c04be2-c834-47ac-b6bf-7f982fdbcce5.pdf","timeframe":"FY27"},{"claim":"The company expects its P&A portfolio to deliver over 25% volume growth during FY27.","quote":"Looking ahead, we expect our P&A portfolio to deliver over 25% volume growth during FY27, supported by a robust innovation pipeline, expanding distribution and favorable industry trends.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=d7c04be2-c834-47ac-b6bf-7f982fdbcce5.pdf","timeframe":"FY27"}],"coverage":{"docs_analysed":3,"kinds":["concall_ppt","concall_transcript"]}},"_meta":{"model":"gemini-3.6-flash","grounded":true,"facts_kept":31,"facts_dropped_ungrounded":3,"note":"Facts are verbatim-grounded against the company's own documents; claims whose quote was not found were dropped."}}